          <h2 class="reveal">The software layer behind direct conversion imaging.</h2>
          <p class="reveal">The Athlos team has been developing X-ray imaging software since the early days of direct conversion — reconstruction algorithms, image processing filters, and TWAIN integration layers that have been deployed in thousands of clinical and industrial installations worldwide.</p>
          <p class="reveal">These software capabilities are available as part of a complete Athlos imaging system, or as independently licensable components for integration into third-party platforms. Athlos also provides SDK access and direct integration support for OEM and system integrator customers.</p>
