            <h3 class="highlight-title">TWAIN Module</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">The Athlos TWAIN module integrates directly with dental and medical imaging software. Supported applications include Dentrix Ascend, Eaglesoft, Open Dental, Dexis, Romexis, and many more TWAIN-enabled platforms. Available as part of a hardware solution or as a standalone licensed component.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="highlight-card reveal" data-delay="80">
