            <h3 class="highlight-title">Reconstruction Algorithms</h3>
            <p class="highlight-body">Advanced reconstruction algorithm libraries developed over decades of direct conversion imaging work. Designed for the specific signal characteristics of CdTe and Si CMOS detectors. Available as a standalone licensable component for integration into imaging system pipelines.</p>
          </div>
